  "title": "Widgetboard: Offline Wall Dashboard",
  "description": "An open-source, offline-first wall dashboard for a Raspberry Pi Zero 2 W. One Go binary serves a live 20-tile grid (finances, markets, calendar, weather, to-dos, system health) to a kiosk display. Admin access is local-network only behind mutual TLS, secrets are encrypted at rest, and setup is a single script. Currently in the planning stage.",
